{{define "endpoints-content"}}
<hgroup>
    <h1>Endpoints</h1>
    <p>Reading <code>{{.Detected.Bastionhub}}</code>'s endpoints.yaml + live tunnel state.</p>
</hgroup>

<article>
    <header><strong>v0.0.1 scaffold</strong></header>
    <p>This view will render the configured endpoints + their live tunnel state: NAME, PORT, USER, STATUS (UP/DOWN), UPTIME, description.</p>
    <p>Actions: click-to-copy <code>bastionhub ssh &lt;name&gt;</code> command to clipboard, click-to-edit (HTMX form to mutate endpoints.yaml), click-to-enroll (multi-step modal for the full enroll flow).</p>
    <p><em>Coming in the second half of v0.1.</em></p>
</article>
{{end}}
